Practical No. 16
User Registration and Login with BCrypt Password Encoding
Spring Boot 3 + Maven + H2 Database + Spring Data JPA + Spring Security
Objective
To implement a database-backed user registration and login mechanism, storing passwords securely with
BCryptPasswordEncoder instead of plain text, and authenticating against the database through a custom
UserDetailsService and a DaoAuthenticationProvider.
